# SessionSense — environment template.
#
# This prototype needs no secrets to run. There is no API key, no database
# credential, no external service call anywhere in detection/ or response/ —
# both halves read local files (parquet/CSV/JSON) and write local files. This
# file is included to satisfy the standard submission checklist and as a
# placeholder for anyone wiring this into a real deployment (see
# docs/architecture.md §3, "Mapping to FEG's live stack"), where
# Kafka/Redis/Postgres connection details would go here.
#
# Nothing below is currently read by any script in this repo.

# KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS=
# REDIS_URL=
# POSTGRES_DSN=
